u only need to shoot them once manually.)\n:unoneshot - Turns off oneshot.\n\n:killaura - Shoots at anyone close to you\n:unkillaura - Turns off killaura\n\n:autoeat - Eats food when you're injured\n:autoeat NUMBER - Sets what health autoeat should start eating at (defaults to healing after any damage)\n:unautoeat - Turns off autoeat\n\n:autogetup - Eats food until you get up whenever you're ragdolled\n:unautoget - Turns off autogetup\n\n:antistomp - Stops you from being stomped, and lets you move around while you're ragdolled\n:unantistomp - Turns you back into a cripple\n\n:autoarrest - If you're on the cop team, this'll automatically arrest any downed criminals near you.\n:unautoarrest - Turns off autoarrest\n\n:superrun - Makes you super fast while holding shift\n:unsuperrun - Turns off superrun\n\n\nX Key: Heal / Eat food\n\nL Key: Toggle super run\n- Key: Lower super run speed\n+ Key: Increase super run speed\n\n\n!! PRESS ' TO TYPE IN COMMAND BAR !!","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62ae4b019b0bb90fc26d9c45","username":"ImAnSkid","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"62ae4b019b0bb90fc26d9c45","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T03:02:32.929Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4e93d","editBy":{"_id":"62ae4b019b0bb90fc26d9c45","username":"ImAnSkid","status":"offline","id":"62ae4b019b0bb90fc26d9c45"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:19:38.258Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6301e8d8774d59be4f58f92f","commentBy":{"_id":"62fe393bebde93fd5e24fd57","username":"ThrillSeeker","verified":false,"role":